        "cooked": "<p>Not your typical editor’s note as things get created live</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-58\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #58</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Another thrilling Editor's Note! Now, with 100% more online collaboration! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:25:31 We're all over the place on this one, as is often the case with live shows... but even MORE so this time! We weave together letter reading,...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, September 6th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#223:</span> Writers’ Room: The Last Temptation of Helena</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 13th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#224:</span> Creative Process: The Harpy foes</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 20th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#59</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 27th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#225:</span> Writers’ Room: Greazer and Fashion Team-Up</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Recording Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, September 2nd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#223:</span> Writers’ Room: The Last Temptation of Helena</li>\n<li>Friday, September 9th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#224:</span> Creative Process: The Harpy foes</li>\n<li>Friday, September 16th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#59</span>\n</li>\n<li>Friday, September 23rd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#225:</span> Writers’ Room: Greazer and Fashion Team-Up</li>\n</ul>",
