        "created_at": "2022-08-23T15:28:46.559Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Nexus Primalis Environment stats look <em>very</em> cool. (And I’m not just saying that because I am very much a <em><strong>Spirit Island</strong></em> fan.)</p>\n<p>They finally acknowledge Water as a Power (in the Alterations column of the Nexus Chart). About time.</p>\n<p>They <em>must</em> keep that Void Jelly reference.</p>\n<p>The Hivenonychus brings to mind Many Minds Move as One, and the Terror-Dactyl reminds me of Shadows Flicker Like Flame.</p>",
