        "cooked": "<p><em>Waiting excitedly for March 2023 since the Kickstarter for digital version just closed</em> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/man_superhero/2.png?v=12\" title=\":man_superhero:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_superhero:t2:\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/zap.png?v=12\" title=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":zap:\"></p>\n<p>As long as we’re throwing out elemental variants of heroes and villains, I think I’ll go with Radiant Rat. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunny.png?v=12\" title=\":sunny:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunny:\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/bulb.png?v=12\" title=\":bulb:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":bulb:\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rat.png?v=12\" title=\":rat:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rat:\"></p>",
